_:B6f00cd9318d0cc63567027afdb83001b a <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#AtomList>.
([<http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#argument1> <urn:swrl#si> ; 
 <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#propertyPredicate> <http://www.essepuntato.it/2009/10/error/hasError> ; 
 <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#argument2> "A step cannot need a resource that will be produced by a following step" ; 
 a <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#DatavaluedPropertyAtom>]) a <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#AtomList>.
([<http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#argument1> <urn:swrl#si> ; 
 <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#classPredicate> pwo:Step ; 
 a <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#ClassAtom>]
 [<http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#argument1> <urn:swrl#sj> ; 
 <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#classPredicate> pwo:Step ; 
 a <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#ClassAtom>]
 [<http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#argument1> <urn:swrl#si> ; 
 <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#argument2> <urn:swrl#r> ; 
 <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#propertyPredicate> pwo:needs ; 
 a <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#IndividualPropertyAtom>]
 [<http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#argument1> <urn:swrl#sj> ; 
 <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#argument2> <urn:swrl#r> ; 
 <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#propertyPredicate> pwo:produces ; 
