<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/sequence.owl#directlyPrecedes> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>.
<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/sequence.owl#precedes> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>.
<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/situation.owl#Situation> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/situation.owl#isSettingFor> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>.
<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/taskexecution.owl#Action> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/taskexecution.owl#executesTask> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>.
<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/taskexecution.owl#isExecutedIn> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>.
<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/taskrole.owl#Task> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/timeindexedsituation.owl#TimeIndexedSituation> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/timeindexedsituation.owl#atTime> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                                                               rdfs:comment "A step is performed within a time interval."@en;
                                                                               rdfs:label "at time"@en.
<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/timeindexedsituation.owl#forEntity> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>.
<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/timeindexedsituation.owl#hasTimeIndexedSetting> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>.
<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/timeinterval.owl#TimeInterval> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
<http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/timeinterval.owl#hasIntervalDate> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>.
<http://www.semanticweb.org/owlapi#nodeID> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
