rdfs:label a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<urn:swrl#r> a <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#Variable>.
<urn:swrl#si> a <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#Variable>.
<urn:swrl#sj> a <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#Variable>.
